# Week 2 - Execution of Data Analysis Process

## Objective

This project implements the data exploration strategy developed during Week 1 using Python.

## Dataset

UCI Bike Sharing Dataset

The dataset contains information about bike rental demand, time, season, weather, temperature, humidity, wind speed, and working-day conditions.

## Analysis Performed

- Dataset ingestion
- Data inspection
- Data type checking
- Missing-value analysis
- Duplicate checking
- Data cleaning
- Data transformation
- Outlier investigation
- Descriptive statistics
- Exploratory data analysis
- Data visualization
- Correlation analysis
- Initial findings

## Python Libraries

- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn

